CATEGORIES:Social,Busch
DESCRIPTION:Start the semester off right at the Physics & Astronomy Ice Cream Social! Join us Tuesday\, September 1st at 5:30pm in Serin 330 for scoops\, a full spread of toppings\, and a soda bar so you can build your own float. We'll have a few games and icebreakers running for anyone who'd rather do something than stand around holding a bowl. Please RSVP if you plan to attend the event.
DTEND:20260901T230000Z
