BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:Social,Cook / Douglass
DESCRIPTION:Every year\, the Endocrinology and Animal Biosciences Graduate Program holds a Welcome Lunch to welcome incoming students and staff members to our program. Food is served and introductions are made\, and it gives the incoming students/faculty as well as the established body a chance to familiarize themselves with one another and discuss interests and research. The EAB welcome lunch is an event our program looks forward to every year\, and we are happy to have it back for Fall 2026.
DTEND:20260904T180000Z
LOCATION:Nassau Street\, Berdines Corners\, North Brunswick Township\, Middlesex County\, New Jersey\, 08902\, United States
